# TheSamTerminal needs NO API keys for market data.
# All market data comes from Binance, CoinGecko, and alternative.me public endpoints.
# Just run `npm install` and `npm run dev` — everything works out of the box.

# ── Optional: shared cache (STRONGLY recommended for serverless deploys) ──
# On Vercel/serverless, each lambda instance has its own memory, so the
# in-memory cache is cold on every new instance and upstream rate limits are
# hit far sooner. Point these at a free Upstash Redis database and the cache
# becomes shared and durable across all instances.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# ── Optional: CoinGecko demo key ──
# Only if CoinGecko's keyless endpoint starts rate-limiting your deployed site.
# Get a FREE Demo key (no credit card) at https://www.coingecko.com/en/api/pricing
# COINGECKO_API_KEY=
